ared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"3e8ZtCnDTu8eRusaigRUhw","review_id":"7zkqesY5ANatQuHmPWlJDg","date":"2012-04-04T15:03:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9298287630081177,"text_excerpt":"The Old Point Bar is a great example of a neighborhood dive bar. Despite growing up in Algiers, I had never been to this bar. Thanks to the recent west bank bar crawl event (Thanks Marielle S. for the itinerary), I got to find out what I had been missing all these years. As I entered I was surprised at the size of the bar. It is fairly large with very high ceilings. There is a very long bar and several tables. There is also a stage and small area behind the stage with a pool table. One odd thing about the bar was that the men's restroom door couldn't be opened all the way. When opening the door it struck the stairway leading to the pool table. I guess this is their way of determining regu..."},{"business_id":"3e8ZtCnDTu8eRusaigRUhw","review_id":"8yr8Zm2EWJe5HVg30Fyavw","date":"2013-09-16T14:49:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9298076629638672,"text_excerpt":"I almost don't want to tell you how much I like this place! Those who have never ventured to Algiers Point are missing out on a cool neighborhood that warrants a walk around, and you're missing out on one great bar! Old Point is a neighborhood joint,located next to the levee on Patterson. They have a pool table and darts. The beer is cheap, no French quarter prices here. The owner usually can be found on a bar stool with his dog laying by his feet. Yes folks, Old Point is canine friendly. Many movies have been shot here and some of the pictures hang on the walls. Actually, take a close look at the walls....so much randomness. Live music almost every night, and no cover. Just be sure to ti..."},{"business_id":"3e8ZtCnDTu8eRusaigRUhw","review_id":"F3jp8UCZSVs2trPydfkh-A","date":"2012-04-06T17:19:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9283936023712158,"text_excerpt":"Solid neighborhood bar with a good selection of beers and liquors. As always if you're driving over to Algiers, I can get lost getting to the point. It is much easier to take the ferry. On the gorgeous spring afternoon, I was last hear (Yay for the Party Bus Wank Bar tour) the windows were all open so any smoke was quickly dissipated. Loved that the regulars were tolerant of our shenanigans. Random fact: the first time I ever came here was the Bonerama CD release party since they recorded their first CD live here."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"3e8ZtCnDTu8eRusaigRUhw","photo_id":"knlvENfdNH69ax3MEDsVjQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/knlvENfdNH69ax3MEDsVjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9226630330085754},{"business_id":"3e8ZtCnDTu8eRusaigRUhw","photo_id":"57GG3PnFhKrMx498Y3inAw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/57GG3PnFhKrMx498Y3inAw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8833905458450317},{"business_id":"3e8ZtCnDTu8eRusaigRUhw","photo_id":"MxRBzSGXv7DUGiAkLHFmFA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/MxRBzSGXv7DUGiAkLHFmFA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8681809902191162},{"business_id":"3e8ZtCnDTu8eRusaigRUhw","photo_id":"Gnjm7OTVqxgVIzYaU8CGlQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Gnjm7OTVqxgVIzYaU8CGlQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8618045449256897},{"business_id":"3e8ZtCnDTu8eRusaigRUhw","photo_id":"MHVvJLPDhWauqiiDixQRZw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/MHVvJLPDhWauqiiDixQRZw.jpg","visual_